   211	## 4. A reusable winding-two theorem
   212	
   213	The same finite calculation gives more than the four rows above.  On the
   214	entire set of `6^4` transposition-valued four-strand states, the action of `X`
   215	has exact order 12 and that of `sigma1` has exact order 6.  Therefore (3.1)
   216	depends only on
